{
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "Of the MSS., four correspond to (i. e. belong to the same set",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "with) Nos. 7—10 for the Nîtis'ataka. Besides these there are,—",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "J. A MS. with commentary kindly lent me by Dr. J. G.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Bühler. I have not used it in collation, as it is incorrect in nearly",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "every line. It comes from Gujarâth.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "A. A MS. lent me by my friend Mr. Kâthavaṭe. It comes",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "like F. from Poona.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "B. An incomplete MS., also lent me by Mr. Kâthavaṭe, also",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "from Poona. This and the last are both tolerably correct, but",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "neither is neatly written, and neither has a commentary.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "I have received lists of the Stanzas in two Kolapore MSS. of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "this S'ataka also from Mr. Athalye. One of these (Y). contains",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "134 Stanzas.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "Of these all the copies contain only 40 Stanzas. All excepting",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "B. J. and G. (which are incomplete) contain 66. The group re-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "presented by C. (the first 7 in the Index) contains 92. The other",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "contains 83. It will be seen from the Indexes, that some Stanzas",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "occur both in the Nîti and the Vairâgya S'atakas, and that too",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "sometimes in copies belonging to one and the same set.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "By an oversight I have omitted in the notes to the first In-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "dex to state, that the numbering in X. of अप्रियवचन &c. and fol-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "lowing Stanzas is incorrect, but has been retained, there being",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "there an additional Stanza introduced by तथाचोक्तम् running as fol-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "lows ॥ आदानस्य प्रदानस्य कर्तव्यस्य च कर्मणः ॥ क्षिप्रमक्रियमाणस्य कालो (sic)",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "पिबति तद्रसम् ॥ In N. (Nîtis'ataka) also, Stanzas 31 and 32 are",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "wanting, and the numbering of the succeeding Stanzas is wrong",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "but is retained. In other cases of wrong numbering in the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "MSS., I have made corrections in the Index.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "It may be stated, that I have given, I believe, all the Various",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Readings occurring in the different copies except those which",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
